      "contextFingerprint": "de8606eb1196c9ac7724ad57ec2afb7a6770b5c14c1cf2824558b08a67b8930f",
      "sourceText": "1. 析构函数，没有返回值也不写void\n2. 函数名称与类名相同,在名称前加上符号  ~\n3. 析构函数不可以有参数，因此不可以发生重载\n4. 程序在对象销毁前会自动调用析构，无须手动调用,而且只会调用一次",
      "translatedText": "1. A destructor has no return value and void is not written either\\.\n2. The function name is the same as the class name, with the symbol \\~ prefixed to the name\\.\n3. A destructor cannot have parameters, so overloading cannot occur\\.\n4. The program automatically calls the destructor before the object is destroyed; there is no need to call it manually, and it is called only once\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 185,
